# --- Phase 2A: MDVR-KCL raw audio dataset (CC-BY-4.0) ---
# The ~606 MB archive and all raw audio must NEVER be committed. The committed
# provenance (PROVENANCE.md, LICENSE.txt) and SHA-256 manifest (manifest.sha256.json)
# under data_audio/ are NOT audio and are intentionally left tracked.
data_audio/mdvr_kcl/raw/
data_audio/mdvr_kcl/26_29_09_2017_KCL.zip
# Defence-in-depth: no audio or archive anywhere under data_audio/, whatever the layout.
data_audio/**/*.wav
data_audio/**/*.zip

# Local editor / preview tooling (not part of the deployable app).
.claude/
